  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.09 Original",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.09 “Original” means the first filing by an owner in a tax year of Form PA-7, “Notice of Intent to Cut Wood or Timber”, containing original signatures of the municipal assessing officials, in the municipality where the cutting of wood is to take place.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 3401.10)",
